1
00:01:36,820 --> 00:01:38,910
[The Lament of Autumn]

2
00:01:39,270 --> 00:01:41,800
[Episode 2]

3
00:01:58,200 --> 00:01:58,700
Okay,

4
00:01:59,420 --> 00:02:00,420
I'll bet with you.

5
00:02:02,350 --> 00:02:03,480
If you win,

6
00:02:04,190 --> 00:02:05,520
you'll make good money

7
00:02:05,980 --> 00:02:08,440
to cover some good medicine
for your mother.

8
00:02:08,520 --> 00:02:09,669
If you lose,

9
00:02:10,680 --> 00:02:12,640
you shall behave and wait for me at home.

10
00:02:12,640 --> 00:02:13,690
I will go meet you.

11
00:02:26,310 --> 00:02:26,970
Changxuan,

12
00:02:28,020 --> 00:02:29,220
why did you let her go?

13
00:02:32,260 --> 00:02:33,790
She's merely a schoolgirl.

14
00:02:34,650 --> 00:02:36,680
Normally speaking, an experience like this

15
00:02:36,680 --> 00:02:38,400
would have scared her stiff.

16
00:02:40,090 --> 00:02:42,490
Yet she actually had the nerve
to provoke me

17
00:02:42,870 --> 00:02:44,280
and bargain with me.

18
00:02:46,250 --> 00:02:47,579
Interesting people are

19
00:02:48,120 --> 00:02:49,079
rare to come by.

20
00:03:09,750 --> 00:03:11,010
By the way, Changxuan,

21
00:03:11,060 --> 00:03:12,650
I talked to Master Jin on the phone.

22
00:03:12,650 --> 00:03:13,130
He said

23
00:03:13,590 --> 00:03:14,400
those assassins

24
00:03:14,400 --> 00:03:15,210
probably sneaked in

25
00:03:15,210 --> 00:03:16,370
during our recruitment

26
00:03:16,370 --> 00:03:17,250
a month ago.

27
00:03:18,020 --> 00:03:19,620
We've lost the trail for now.

28
00:03:19,630 --> 00:03:21,829
I'll try to trace the source of the guns.

29
00:03:34,740 --> 00:03:35,410
Mrs. Zhao.

30
00:03:36,470 --> 00:03:38,340
Pingjun, you're finally back.

31
00:03:38,410 --> 00:03:39,460
Go check in on your mom.

32
00:03:39,460 --> 00:03:41,190
She's been coughing all night.

33
00:03:42,020 --> 00:03:42,630
Thank you.

34
00:03:42,630 --> 00:03:43,530
Hurry.

35
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:51,020
Mother, Mother.

36
00:03:53,150 --> 00:03:53,970
Let me help you up.

37
00:03:53,970 --> 00:03:54,470
Come on.

38
00:04:11,130 --> 00:04:12,840
What kept you out so late?

39
00:04:15,430 --> 00:04:17,740
I went for an interview
at Xiangxi Hotel today

40
00:04:17,740 --> 00:04:18,680
and did a trial shift,

41
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:19,880
so I'm home a bit late.

42
00:04:23,010 --> 00:04:23,740
Pingjun.

43
00:04:27,220 --> 00:04:28,630
It's all my fault.

44
00:04:29,720 --> 00:04:30,500
I'm sorry

45
00:04:31,310 --> 00:04:32,570
for dragging you down.

46
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:34,040
You haven't had

47
00:04:34,680 --> 00:04:35,830
a single easy day

48
00:04:36,920 --> 00:04:38,930
or enjoyed any happy moments

49
00:04:39,510 --> 00:04:41,040
growing up with me.

50
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:42,659
Mother,

51
00:04:43,120 --> 00:04:44,650
what are you talking about?

52
00:04:45,120 --> 00:04:47,010
Being able to stay

53
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:48,480
by your side

54
00:04:48,680 --> 00:04:49,940
is already a blessing.

55
00:04:50,300 --> 00:04:51,300
It takes several lifetimes

56
00:04:51,300 --> 00:04:52,500
of merit to earn this.

57
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:04,360
[Yuchun Theater]

58
00:05:24,360 --> 00:05:25,620
Fifth Young Master Yu.

59
00:05:26,270 --> 00:05:26,750
Miss,

60
00:05:26,830 --> 00:05:28,490
Fifth Young Master Yu is here.

61
00:05:34,270 --> 00:05:34,690
Keep

62
00:05:34,690 --> 00:05:36,460
this dried tangerine peel for your lady.

63
00:05:36,460 --> 00:05:37,540
Taking some every day

64
00:05:37,540 --> 00:05:38,800
is good for her throat.

65
00:05:39,750 --> 00:05:42,750
Dried tangerine peel is said to be
as pricey as gold.

66
00:05:43,159 --> 00:05:43,770
Miss,

67
00:05:43,770 --> 00:05:44,330
Fifth Young Master Yu

68
00:05:44,330 --> 00:05:45,360
brought you such a precious gift.

69
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,930
He really cares about you.

70
00:05:50,750 --> 00:05:51,570
A woman's heart

71
00:05:51,570 --> 00:05:53,010
is harder than a bullet.

72
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,320
Are you not worried about

73
00:05:57,060 --> 00:05:59,060
yesterday's assassination at all?

74
00:06:01,370 --> 00:06:03,890
Given your capabilities,
Fifth Young Master Yu,

75
00:06:03,890 --> 00:06:05,350
you would be fine for sure.

76
00:06:19,070 --> 00:06:20,930
Did you find out who was behind it?

77
00:06:21,270 --> 00:06:21,750
People

78
00:06:21,750 --> 00:06:23,680
who want to kill me abound in Nanhuai,

79
00:06:23,680 --> 00:06:25,040
but few have the guts

80
00:06:25,040 --> 00:06:25,880
to make a move

81
00:06:26,810 --> 00:06:27,810
at Xiangxi Hotel.

82
00:06:28,250 --> 00:06:30,120
When I went to the event yesterday,

83
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,130
I heard them say

84
00:06:32,100 --> 00:06:34,620
someone was interested
in the land in Changping Mountain

85
00:06:34,620 --> 00:06:36,550
and was determined to purchase it.

86
00:06:38,420 --> 00:06:40,020
What did you sing yesterday?

87
00:06:41,360 --> 00:06:43,290
"The Phoenix Hairpin," of course.

88
00:06:47,010 --> 00:06:48,740
You still haven't gotten tired

89
00:06:49,860 --> 00:06:51,720
of singing it after so many years?

90
00:06:55,870 --> 00:06:56,680
Ziyi,

91
00:06:56,770 --> 00:06:57,500
Fifth Young Master Yu

92
00:06:57,500 --> 00:06:58,740
risked his own life

93
00:06:58,770 --> 00:07:00,270
to save you yesterday.

94
00:07:00,570 --> 00:07:02,480
That indicates no ordinary relationship.

95
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:03,070
Have you two

96
00:07:03,070 --> 00:07:04,180
been hooking up for quite a while

97
00:07:04,180 --> 00:07:05,760
and kept it a secret from us?

98
00:07:05,990 --> 00:07:09,270
[Dulcet Singing]

99
00:07:07,510 --> 00:07:08,110
Come here.

100
00:07:10,600 --> 00:07:12,120
Did you see Fifth Young Master Yu?

101
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,160
I think Fifth Young Master Yu

102
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,760
went to Miss Lan Qing's room.

103
00:07:19,180 --> 00:07:19,980
Ziyi!

104
00:07:22,830 --> 00:07:23,500
Lan Qing.

105
00:07:26,190 --> 00:07:27,160
Actually, you don't have to sing here

106
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:28,560
for the rest of your life.

107
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:29,980
If you want

108
00:07:29,980 --> 00:07:31,580
to go anywhere in the future,

109
00:07:31,810 --> 00:07:33,140
I'll arrange it for you.

110
00:07:38,240 --> 00:07:39,570
I'm not going anywhere.

111
00:07:42,020 --> 00:07:43,230
I'll just stay here.

112
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:47,980
Whenever you want to listen to a song,

113
00:07:49,010 --> 00:07:49,740
I'll be here.

114
00:08:04,130 --> 00:08:05,200
Why doesn't this pencil

115
00:08:05,200 --> 00:08:06,790
feel right in my hand today?

116
00:08:41,419 --> 00:08:42,299
Is it good?

117
00:08:52,250 --> 00:08:53,340
Satisfied now?

118
00:08:56,860 --> 00:08:58,190
I'll be waiting for you.

119
00:09:21,550 --> 00:09:22,400
Excuse me,

120
00:09:22,650 --> 00:09:23,980
did Feng Yao come today?

121
00:09:24,100 --> 00:09:24,830
She took the day off

122
00:09:24,830 --> 00:09:25,860
and didn't come to school.

123
00:09:25,860 --> 00:09:28,170
Then do you know where she lives?

124
00:09:29,860 --> 00:09:30,840
Nope.

125
00:09:30,940 --> 00:09:32,410
She transferred here last semester.

126
00:09:32,410 --> 00:09:33,740
None of us know her well.

127
00:09:34,410 --> 00:09:35,340
Seems like

128
00:09:35,550 --> 00:09:37,880
I need to go to Xiangxi Hotel
to find clues.

129
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:40,030
[List of Hires]

130
00:09:38,200 --> 00:09:39,200
Sun Mengxian goes

131
00:09:39,370 --> 00:09:40,900
to the western restaurant.

132
00:09:42,010 --> 00:09:42,940
Zhou Yanchu goes

133
00:09:43,270 --> 00:09:44,200
to the ballroom.

134
00:09:44,250 --> 00:09:46,250
Yu Lanlan goes to the housekeeping.

135
00:09:46,250 --> 00:09:47,180
Chen Yongli goes

136
00:09:47,390 --> 00:09:48,290
to the reception.

137
00:09:48,290 --> 00:09:48,890
Thank you, Master Jin.

138
00:09:48,890 --> 00:09:49,950
-Thank you, Master Jin.
-Thank you, Master Jin.

139
00:09:49,950 --> 00:09:51,360
Thank you, Master Jin.

140
00:09:53,500 --> 00:09:56,050
Ye Pingjun, you are assigned
to the opera hall.

141
00:09:56,050 --> 00:09:57,980
You will work in the Yuchun Troupe.

142
00:09:58,410 --> 00:09:59,890
This is Troupe Leader Qian.

143
00:09:59,890 --> 00:10:01,290
From now on, he'll be in charge

144
00:10:01,290 --> 00:10:02,750
of your work assignments.

145
00:10:03,410 --> 00:10:04,670
Thank you, Master Jin.

146
00:10:05,870 --> 00:10:06,400
This way,

147
00:10:06,720 --> 00:10:07,180
please.

148
00:10:07,650 --> 00:10:08,310
Ye Pingjun.

149
00:10:09,790 --> 00:10:11,120
I heard that last night,

150
00:10:11,360 --> 00:10:13,160
Fifth Young Master Yu let you go.

151
00:10:14,270 --> 00:10:15,000
Miss Ye,

152
00:10:16,750 --> 00:10:18,210
you're really something.

153
00:10:25,750 --> 00:10:27,200
Miss Ye, please.

154
00:10:36,860 --> 00:10:38,190
The theater is up ahead.

155
00:10:39,720 --> 00:10:40,820
Troupe Leader Qian,

156
00:10:40,820 --> 00:10:41,790
what exactly

157
00:10:41,860 --> 00:10:42,990
does my job involve?

158
00:10:43,620 --> 00:10:45,820
You will mainly copy scripts

159
00:10:45,860 --> 00:10:46,670
and

160
00:10:46,670 --> 00:10:48,960
read scripts to the most popular artist
of our troupe,

161
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,790
Miss Lan Qing.

162
00:10:52,110 --> 00:10:57,680
[Chunfeng Troupe]

163
00:10:57,790 --> 00:10:58,980
This is the Chunfeng Troupe

164
00:10:58,980 --> 00:10:59,820
of our hotel.

165
00:11:01,150 --> 00:11:02,810
The theater is right up there.

166
00:11:07,730 --> 00:11:08,900
["A Dream in the Garden" by Lan Qing]

167
00:11:14,460 --> 00:11:17,630
Miss Lan Qing is really good
at dancing with water sleeves.

168
00:11:17,630 --> 00:11:19,500
But unfortunately, she is illiterate

169
00:11:19,500 --> 00:11:21,250
and can't read new scripts.

170
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:23,050
She needs someone to read them

171
00:11:23,130 --> 00:11:24,820
line by line.

172
00:11:27,150 --> 00:11:31,320
-Nice!
-Bravo!

173
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:16,720
Miss Tao,

174
00:12:16,720 --> 00:12:19,450
what brings you here
to listen to the opera today?

175
00:12:20,200 --> 00:12:20,960
What?

176
00:12:21,500 --> 00:12:24,010
Is this opera only for you,
Fifth Young Master Yu,

177
00:12:24,010 --> 00:12:24,960
but not for me?

178
00:12:25,500 --> 00:12:27,170
Then I must thank you
on behalf of Lan Qing

179
00:12:27,170 --> 00:12:29,170
for gracing her with your presence.

180
00:12:31,500 --> 00:12:32,630
My sister said

181
00:12:32,890 --> 00:12:34,220
you saved me yesterday,

182
00:12:34,440 --> 00:12:35,550
so I should

183
00:12:35,840 --> 00:12:37,250
express my gratitude.

184
00:12:38,100 --> 00:12:39,770
There's no need for formalities

185
00:12:39,770 --> 00:12:40,500
between us.

186
00:13:00,010 --> 00:13:00,670
Be careful.

187
00:13:00,670 --> 00:13:01,670
Don't wrinkle it.

188
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:05,900
Troupe Leader.

189
00:13:12,130 --> 00:13:13,260
Troupe Leader Qian.

190
00:13:14,290 --> 00:13:14,790
Troupe Leader.

191
00:13:14,790 --> 00:13:15,650
Troupe Leader.

192
00:13:16,620 --> 00:13:19,650
-Bravo!
-Nice!

193
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,460
The one on stage

194
00:13:21,460 --> 00:13:22,410
is the most popular star

195
00:13:22,410 --> 00:13:23,600
of our troupe,

196
00:13:23,720 --> 00:13:24,960
Miss Lan Qing.

197
00:13:26,550 --> 00:13:27,550
So noisy!

198
00:13:29,530 --> 00:13:31,990
Like they've never watched
an opera before!

199
00:13:35,960 --> 00:13:37,000
Oh, Taochun.

200
00:13:37,720 --> 00:13:38,720
Lan Qing

201
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:40,300
is the most popular star

202
00:13:40,320 --> 00:13:41,720
of our Yuchun Troupe.

203
00:13:41,960 --> 00:13:43,200
Cheering for her

204
00:13:43,360 --> 00:13:45,320
brings honor to us.

205
00:13:46,220 --> 00:13:48,550
She hooked up
with Eldest Young Master Yu before.

206
00:13:48,550 --> 00:13:50,250
But right after he died in battle,

207
00:13:50,250 --> 00:13:52,150
she just turned
to follow Fifth Young Master Yu.

208
00:13:52,150 --> 00:13:53,290
She's got him crazy for her,

209
00:13:53,290 --> 00:13:54,860
keeping his "sister-in-law" as a mistress.

210
00:13:54,860 --> 00:13:56,860
How is she our troupe's top star?

211
00:13:56,860 --> 00:13:57,530
She is literally

212
00:13:57,530 --> 00:13:58,750
the top star of sex scandals!

213
00:13:58,750 --> 00:13:59,740
Oh, my goodness,

214
00:14:00,150 --> 00:14:00,970
watch your mouth!

215
00:14:00,970 --> 00:14:02,030
Do you want to die?

216
00:14:02,220 --> 00:14:04,250
How dare you gossip
about Fifth Young Master Yu?

217
00:14:04,250 --> 00:14:05,700
If word gets out,

218
00:14:05,770 --> 00:14:07,290
even our troupe will...

219
00:14:09,720 --> 00:14:11,050
I didn't hear anything.

220
00:14:13,650 --> 00:14:14,790
Here's the thing.

221
00:14:15,340 --> 00:14:17,010
In our Xiangxi Hotel,

222
00:14:17,150 --> 00:14:18,360
you must remember that

223
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,560
Fifth Young Master Yu

224
00:14:19,600 --> 00:14:20,740
is the last one

225
00:14:20,740 --> 00:14:22,140
you can afford to offend.

226
00:14:22,500 --> 00:14:24,010
You have no idea...

227
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:25,390
-Bravo!
-Bravo!

228
00:14:25,390 --> 00:14:26,990
Anyway, just keep it in mind.

229
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:31,130
-Encore!
-Encore!

230
00:14:31,580 --> 00:14:32,910
Encore!

231
00:14:34,050 --> 00:14:34,860
Bravo!

232
00:14:35,750 --> 00:14:37,810
These opera fans are quite generous.

233
00:14:51,670 --> 00:14:53,080
Wow, these hair ornaments!

234
00:14:53,080 --> 00:14:54,240
How lavish!

235
00:14:59,670 --> 00:15:00,170
It's so hard

236
00:15:00,170 --> 00:15:01,890
to read Fifth Young Master Yu's mind.

237
00:15:01,890 --> 00:15:03,130
Yesterday, he risked his life

238
00:15:03,130 --> 00:15:04,000
for Ziyi.

239
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:05,670
Today, he spent a fortune

240
00:15:05,670 --> 00:15:06,670
on Lan Qing.

241
00:15:10,320 --> 00:15:12,650
She's no more than
a humble opera performer.

242
00:15:12,650 --> 00:15:14,980
When men are in a good mood,
they have fun with her.

243
00:15:14,980 --> 00:15:17,380
But when they're not,
they just discard her

244
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:18,680
and forget about her.

245
00:15:19,620 --> 00:15:20,340
She's just

246
00:15:20,340 --> 00:15:21,720
a plaything for men.

247
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:38,730
Where are you going?

248
00:15:52,700 --> 00:15:54,940
Troupe Leader Qian said
the contract was signed

249
00:15:54,940 --> 00:15:56,470
and asked you to take a look.

250
00:15:56,530 --> 00:15:57,260
Please go in.

251
00:15:58,890 --> 00:15:59,510
Thank you.

252
00:16:01,740 --> 00:16:07,220
[Yuchun Theater]

253
00:16:11,040 --> 00:16:11,850
Come in.

254
00:16:27,320 --> 00:16:28,250
It's you?

255
00:16:33,550 --> 00:16:34,670
So you are

256
00:16:34,670 --> 00:16:35,890
the real boss

257
00:16:35,890 --> 00:16:36,960
behind Master Jin.

258
00:16:37,880 --> 00:16:39,140
You're quick-witted.

259
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:43,020
I don't want this job anymore.

260
00:16:43,390 --> 00:16:45,450
You've already signed the contract.

261
00:16:46,320 --> 00:16:47,450
And I've stamped it.

262
00:16:47,980 --> 00:16:49,040
It's now in effect.

263
00:16:50,080 --> 00:16:51,080
For the next year,

264
00:16:51,150 --> 00:16:51,860
you must obey

265
00:16:51,860 --> 00:16:53,260
any orders from the boss.

266
00:16:53,660 --> 00:16:55,630
[Juvenile trainee or apprentice:
Ye Pingjun]

267
00:16:57,000 --> 00:16:59,000
If I had known that you were the boss,

268
00:16:59,000 --> 00:17:00,680
I wouldn't have signed it.

269
00:17:00,520 --> 00:17:03,010
[Xiangxi Hotel Employment Contract]

270
00:17:01,500 --> 00:17:03,460
One silver dollar
for breach of contract, right?

271
00:17:03,460 --> 00:17:04,089
Alright,

272
00:17:04,700 --> 00:17:05,510
I'll pay it.

273
00:17:05,540 --> 00:17:05,849
[Juvenile trainee or apprentice:
Ye Pingjun] [Employer: Yu Changxuan]

274
00:17:13,440 --> 00:17:16,450
[Needs to pay the employer for breach
of contract: 100 silver dollars]

275
00:17:19,599 --> 00:17:21,280
[Needs to pay the employer for breach
of contract: 100 silver dollars]

276
00:17:21,300 --> 00:17:24,569
[Juvenile trainee or apprentice:
Ye Pingjun] [Employer: Yu Changxuan]

277
00:17:22,550 --> 00:17:23,250
Pay it,

278
00:17:23,900 --> 00:17:24,900
and we'll be even.

279
00:17:26,420 --> 00:17:28,140
You tampered
with the contract arbitrarily.

280
00:17:28,140 --> 00:17:29,000
Are you any different

281
00:17:29,000 --> 00:17:29,940
from a shameless scoundrel?

282
00:17:29,830 --> 00:17:32,520
[Juvenile trainee or apprentice:
Ye Pingjun] [Employer: Yu Changxuan]

283
00:17:30,790 --> 00:17:31,610
Do you really think

284
00:17:31,610 --> 00:17:33,030
law doesn't exist in Nanhuai,

285
00:17:33,030 --> 00:17:34,830
and you can do whatever you want?

286
00:17:34,890 --> 00:17:36,380
The Nanhuai High Court

287
00:17:36,900 --> 00:17:38,900
is located at Jia No. 2, East Street.

288
00:17:39,030 --> 00:17:40,090
Feel free to sue me anytime.

289
00:17:40,090 --> 00:17:42,000
However, just a kind reminder—

290
00:17:43,850 --> 00:17:44,850
our bet

291
00:17:45,700 --> 00:17:46,760
is only for 10 days.

292
00:17:47,510 --> 00:17:49,090
You're running out of time.

293
00:17:53,590 --> 00:17:54,250
Come back.

294
00:17:57,700 --> 00:17:58,500
Sit down.

295
00:18:15,640 --> 00:18:17,500
Since I hired you at a high salary,

296
00:18:18,940 --> 00:18:19,990
I must

297
00:18:20,740 --> 00:18:22,330
test you for Lan Qing.

298
00:18:23,220 --> 00:18:26,780
["Tears on a Cyan Robe"]

299
00:18:24,220 --> 00:18:25,350
Read me a paragraph.

300
00:18:38,090 --> 00:18:39,050
Mencius said,

301
00:18:39,770 --> 00:18:41,900
"A sense of shame is
so important to people.

302
00:18:41,900 --> 00:18:43,740
With it, one may become a sage;

303
00:18:44,050 --> 00:18:46,350
losing it, one is no better than a beast."

304
00:18:46,900 --> 00:18:48,460
Mencius meant that

305
00:18:48,790 --> 00:18:49,640
the most important thing

306
00:18:49,640 --> 00:18:51,570
for a man is to have a sense of shame.

307
00:18:51,810 --> 00:18:53,720
Those without a sense of shame

308
00:18:53,900 --> 00:18:55,500
will only end up like beasts.

309
00:18:58,640 --> 00:19:01,040
I fired a shot
at the training ground today.

310
00:19:02,660 --> 00:19:04,250
It was a fine steed,

311
00:19:05,590 --> 00:19:07,190
and I was also very fond of it.

312
00:19:07,660 --> 00:19:09,790
But unfortunately, it was untamable.

313
00:19:12,800 --> 00:19:14,730
So what was the point of keeping it?

314
00:19:17,380 --> 00:19:18,780
Everything in this world

315
00:19:19,090 --> 00:19:20,500
has its own fate.

316
00:19:20,810 --> 00:19:21,550
Some things are

317
00:19:21,550 --> 00:19:23,550
destined not to be yours to command.

318
00:19:23,590 --> 00:19:25,160
It won't listen to you

319
00:19:25,940 --> 00:19:27,340
even if you take its life.

320
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:29,830
What a pity.

321
00:19:31,680 --> 00:19:33,660
I'm just a stubborn person.

322
00:19:36,700 --> 00:19:37,900
I was born with a bad habit

323
00:19:37,900 --> 00:19:39,510
of never taking advice.

324
00:19:40,810 --> 00:19:42,220
For a disobedient horse,

325
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:44,900
I just shot it dead.

326
00:19:46,380 --> 00:19:47,850
For disobedient people,

327
00:19:48,790 --> 00:19:50,030
I'll pull out

328
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:52,400
their "thorns"

329
00:19:54,270 --> 00:19:55,400
one by one.

330
00:20:11,790 --> 00:20:12,990
What brings you here?

331
00:20:14,140 --> 00:20:16,200
I thought you went somewhere for fun.

332
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,290
It turns out that you're

333
00:20:17,290 --> 00:20:19,200
staring at a little girl here.

334
00:20:19,790 --> 00:20:20,640
Is it fun?

335
00:20:24,030 --> 00:20:24,940
Ye Pingjun?

336
00:20:27,030 --> 00:20:28,360
What are you doing here?

337
00:20:32,420 --> 00:20:33,980
I work at the Yuchun Troupe.

338
00:20:34,700 --> 00:20:35,830
You know each other?

339
00:20:37,030 --> 00:20:38,400
We're schoolmates

340
00:20:38,420 --> 00:20:39,750
and have met a few times.

341
00:20:42,030 --> 00:20:42,890
This is weird.

342
00:20:42,980 --> 00:20:44,110
How did you sneak in?

343
00:20:45,010 --> 00:20:46,750
Even a servant here should have

344
00:20:47,160 --> 00:20:47,790
a father or brother

345
00:20:47,790 --> 00:20:49,190
with some official rank.

346
00:20:49,570 --> 00:20:51,170
But what's your background?

347
00:20:51,610 --> 00:20:52,710
Did you

348
00:20:53,070 --> 00:20:54,630
fake your resume?

349
00:20:54,900 --> 00:20:56,430
Miss Tao, your imagination

350
00:20:56,460 --> 00:20:57,590
is wild.

351
00:20:59,790 --> 00:21:00,880
At school,

352
00:21:01,010 --> 00:21:03,470
you make money
by doing homework for others.

353
00:21:04,090 --> 00:21:05,290
After school,

354
00:21:05,290 --> 00:21:07,500
you do part-time jobs everywhere.

355
00:21:07,520 --> 00:21:09,220
Yet you still haven't earned enough?

356
00:21:09,220 --> 00:21:11,830
You've even stooped
to serving an opera performer.

357
00:21:11,830 --> 00:21:13,490
You really have no bottom line

358
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:15,660
when it comes to making money.

359
00:21:17,200 --> 00:21:18,010
You're right.

360
00:21:18,330 --> 00:21:20,640
I'll do anything to make money.

361
00:21:21,830 --> 00:21:22,570
You can also come to me

362
00:21:22,570 --> 00:21:23,830
for anything you need.

363
00:21:23,920 --> 00:21:26,490
Be it doing homework, shopping,
or walking dogs,

364
00:21:26,490 --> 00:21:28,820
I can do everything. The more, the better.

365
00:21:38,110 --> 00:21:39,690
Darn it! Are you blind?

366
00:21:41,310 --> 00:21:41,880
Sorry.

367
00:21:45,440 --> 00:21:47,860
Isn't this Director Liang Wenbo

368
00:21:48,050 --> 00:21:49,850
from the Chunfeng Drama Troupe?

369
00:21:50,110 --> 00:21:50,680
Sorry,

370
00:21:50,680 --> 00:21:52,080
I didn't do it on purpose.

371
00:21:54,980 --> 00:21:56,640
Excuse me. Please let me pass.

372
00:21:57,850 --> 00:21:59,290
I heard...

373
00:22:00,790 --> 00:22:02,110
Director Liang, I heard you

374
00:22:02,110 --> 00:22:03,610
just wrote a new play

375
00:22:04,180 --> 00:22:05,190
called

376
00:22:05,810 --> 00:22:07,140
"Elegant Rendezvous."

377
00:22:07,530 --> 00:22:08,160
Yes.

378
00:22:08,660 --> 00:22:09,790
It'll premiere next month.

379
00:22:09,790 --> 00:22:11,000
If you are interested,

380
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:12,420
you are welcome to come and watch.

381
00:22:12,420 --> 00:22:14,620
The title of your play is quite strange.

382
00:22:15,550 --> 00:22:16,940
What does it mean?

383
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:21,420
Literally, it means

384
00:22:22,250 --> 00:22:23,360
a secret rendezvous

385
00:22:23,360 --> 00:22:24,690
in an elegant demeanor.

386
00:22:25,590 --> 00:22:27,840
Rendezvous? Elegant? What does that mean?

387
00:22:27,840 --> 00:22:29,500
You'll know
if you have a chance to see it.

388
00:22:29,500 --> 00:22:30,450
Excuse me.

389
00:22:34,420 --> 00:22:35,680
I only know that

390
00:22:35,750 --> 00:22:38,940
marrying a good man
is the best way to secure your future.

391
00:22:44,530 --> 00:22:45,900
[Exclusively for Xiangxi Hotel]

392
00:22:46,330 --> 00:22:47,380
There's no such name

393
00:22:47,380 --> 00:22:48,640
on the interview list.

394
00:22:49,030 --> 00:22:51,090
Are you sure you remember correctly?

395
00:22:56,960 --> 00:22:59,620
So Feng Yao really
didn't attend the interview.

396
00:23:00,420 --> 00:23:02,620
It seems that she is indeed suspicious.

397
00:23:15,590 --> 00:23:16,550
You're back

398
00:23:17,590 --> 00:23:19,050
from Shenyang so quickly.

399
00:23:19,160 --> 00:23:20,220
I was only away for one day,

400
00:23:20,220 --> 00:23:21,900
and something this serious happened.

401
00:23:21,900 --> 00:23:22,660
Therefore,

402
00:23:23,380 --> 00:23:24,380
only with you here

403
00:23:25,200 --> 00:23:27,730
will those underlings
dare not make trouble.

404
00:23:30,350 --> 00:23:31,750
Have you found any clues?

405
00:23:32,720 --> 00:23:33,590
The old man is investigating.

406
00:23:33,590 --> 00:23:34,590
He will handle it.

407
00:23:56,850 --> 00:23:58,050
You and your brother

408
00:23:58,790 --> 00:24:00,450
share exactly the same habit.

409
00:24:28,050 --> 00:24:28,850
Jin,

410
00:24:30,010 --> 00:24:32,010
your taste in wine is getting worse.

411
00:24:32,750 --> 00:24:34,150
It tastes so astringent.

412
00:24:40,550 --> 00:24:42,480
But their tempers are as different

413
00:24:42,490 --> 00:24:43,870
as chalk and cheese.

414
00:24:48,500 --> 00:24:48,960
Father,

415
00:24:49,330 --> 00:24:50,660
this is the bullet found at the scene

416
00:24:50,660 --> 00:24:52,350
where Changxuan was assassinated.

417
00:24:52,350 --> 00:24:54,280
It's verified to be from Palm Bolt.

418
00:24:54,460 --> 00:24:55,120
Currently,

419
00:24:55,310 --> 00:24:57,640
only Mu Linsen's army is equipped with it.

420
00:24:58,900 --> 00:24:59,940
Mu Linsen.

421
00:25:01,740 --> 00:25:04,100
He was trying to sabotage

422
00:25:04,220 --> 00:25:05,680
our Yu-Chu allied forces.

423
00:25:06,960 --> 00:25:08,500
This man's been vicious,

424
00:25:08,900 --> 00:25:11,090
always playing tricks in the dark.

425
00:25:11,590 --> 00:25:13,530
The assassins were all death row inmates

426
00:25:13,530 --> 00:25:14,830
who were secretly swapped out

427
00:25:14,830 --> 00:25:16,160
and taken from death row

428
00:25:16,350 --> 00:25:18,050
one by one in a month.

429
00:25:20,400 --> 00:25:22,530
No matter how far Mu Linsen's reach is,

430
00:25:24,000 --> 00:25:27,330
he must have had someone
colluding with him from the inside.

431
00:25:27,660 --> 00:25:28,750
Go back to Nanhuai

432
00:25:29,400 --> 00:25:30,860
and get to the bottom of it.

433
00:25:31,030 --> 00:25:31,640
Yes.

434
00:25:50,220 --> 00:25:51,590
Come on,

435
00:25:52,270 --> 00:25:53,570
my future in-law,

436
00:25:55,030 --> 00:25:57,050
I paid this visit today

437
00:25:57,330 --> 00:25:59,260
to specifically apologize to you.

438
00:26:02,770 --> 00:26:03,850
It was indeed my fault

439
00:26:03,850 --> 00:26:04,910
for not telling you

440
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:07,030
the assassination plan in advance.

441
00:26:07,030 --> 00:26:09,160
But my men knew when to stop

442
00:26:09,610 --> 00:26:12,410
and would never hurt
your two precious daughters.

443
00:26:12,830 --> 00:26:14,350
You caused such a commotion,

444
00:26:14,350 --> 00:26:15,280
yet Yu Changxuan

445
00:26:15,590 --> 00:26:17,150
is still alive and well, isn't he?

446
00:26:17,150 --> 00:26:18,240
The Yu family helped Chu Wenfu

447
00:26:18,240 --> 00:26:19,220
seize my turf.

448
00:26:19,980 --> 00:26:22,770
And now they want to join forces
with the Chu family.

449
00:26:22,770 --> 00:26:24,830
Going after the Yu family's only heir

450
00:26:25,030 --> 00:26:26,810
is a warning to Yu Zhongquan,

451
00:26:27,460 --> 00:26:29,190
showing him my stance clearly.

452
00:26:29,550 --> 00:26:30,610
Let's see if he will

453
00:26:31,570 --> 00:26:32,940
back out of the alliance

454
00:26:33,680 --> 00:26:34,940
or insist on his folly.

455
00:26:36,920 --> 00:26:39,440
If Yu Zhongquan holds onto the alliance,

456
00:26:39,550 --> 00:26:40,950
do you have a backup plan?

457
00:26:41,720 --> 00:26:42,250
I, Mu Linsen,

458
00:26:42,250 --> 00:26:44,110
only believe in one simple truth.

459
00:26:45,510 --> 00:26:47,530
If I can't have a major force

460
00:26:48,010 --> 00:26:49,610
like the Yu family on my side,

461
00:26:49,980 --> 00:26:51,610
then no one else can.

462
00:26:52,460 --> 00:26:53,740
If Yu Zhongquan is dead-set

463
00:26:53,740 --> 00:26:54,900
on being Chu Wenfu's right-hand man

464
00:26:54,900 --> 00:26:56,100
and going against me,

465
00:26:57,850 --> 00:26:58,850
I will remove

466
00:26:58,850 --> 00:27:00,180
this thorn myself.

467
00:27:10,200 --> 00:27:10,920
Hello?

468
00:27:11,010 --> 00:27:12,000
Anybody home?

469
00:27:16,220 --> 00:27:16,960
Feng Yao.

470
00:27:18,700 --> 00:27:19,310
Feng Yao?

471
00:27:47,300 --> 00:27:48,340
Medicine dregs?

472
00:27:50,440 --> 00:27:52,500
Someone is sick in Feng Yao's family?

473
00:28:02,550 --> 00:28:05,140
Ephedra, notopterygium, poria.

474
00:28:07,030 --> 00:28:08,160
This is almost the same

475
00:28:08,160 --> 00:28:09,620
as my mom's prescription.

476
00:28:14,220 --> 00:28:15,440
So you mean this girl.

477
00:28:15,790 --> 00:28:16,720
Yeah, I know her.

478
00:28:16,750 --> 00:28:17,550
She comes here

479
00:28:17,550 --> 00:28:18,880
to get meds every month.

480
00:28:19,740 --> 00:28:20,270
Then

481
00:28:20,570 --> 00:28:21,460
when was the last time

482
00:28:21,460 --> 00:28:22,460
you saw her?

483
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:24,290
Her father has lung disease.

484
00:28:24,290 --> 00:28:26,200
The meds he uses are very expensive.

485
00:28:26,200 --> 00:28:27,610
She's barely scraped together

486
00:28:27,610 --> 00:28:28,870
enough money for them.

487
00:28:28,980 --> 00:28:29,640
Well, then,

488
00:28:29,810 --> 00:28:30,400
do you know

489
00:28:30,400 --> 00:28:31,740
where she moved to?

490
00:28:31,830 --> 00:28:32,740
She moved?

491
00:28:33,980 --> 00:28:35,310
I honestly have no idea.

492
00:28:36,740 --> 00:28:38,960
I hope she moved to a good place.

493
00:28:39,960 --> 00:28:41,400
What do you mean?

494
00:28:41,790 --> 00:28:43,830
The little girl's lived a tough life.

495
00:28:43,830 --> 00:28:44,770
It's

496
00:28:45,090 --> 00:28:46,110
just her

497
00:28:46,200 --> 00:28:48,220
and her seriously ill father at home.

498
00:28:48,220 --> 00:28:50,220
She takes care of him all by herself.

499
00:28:50,440 --> 00:28:51,940
She is such a filial child.

500
00:28:52,500 --> 00:28:54,160
It makes me feel sorry for her.

501
00:28:54,460 --> 00:28:55,200
Tomorrow night

502
00:28:55,200 --> 00:28:57,510
happens to be when she usually
comes to get meds.

503
00:28:57,510 --> 00:28:59,110
I wonder if she will come.

504
00:29:01,650 --> 00:29:04,410
[Yuchun Theater]

505
00:29:21,700 --> 00:29:22,740
Miss Lan Qing,

506
00:29:23,200 --> 00:29:24,800
I'm done copying the script.

507
00:29:24,810 --> 00:29:26,340
Let me read you a paragraph.

508
00:29:26,480 --> 00:29:27,270
Okay.

509
00:29:32,090 --> 00:29:33,680
"Beneath the moon hanging high in the sky,

510
00:29:33,680 --> 00:29:35,440
clouds drift close along the path.

511
00:29:35,440 --> 00:29:38,240
Chilled to the bone,
I even dread a dream of autumn.

512
00:29:38,640 --> 00:29:41,270
What in the world runs deeper than love?

513
00:29:42,070 --> 00:29:45,180
It leaves only soul-crushing heartache."

514
00:29:47,510 --> 00:29:48,300
Miss Ye,

515
00:29:49,570 --> 00:29:50,900
although I can't read,

516
00:29:51,350 --> 00:29:52,720
I can tell that

517
00:29:53,170 --> 00:29:54,170
your handwriting

518
00:29:54,460 --> 00:29:57,390
is prettier than others'.
You put your heart into it.

519
00:29:59,570 --> 00:30:00,700
Miss Lan Qing,

520
00:30:01,070 --> 00:30:02,530
I'm flattered.

521
00:30:05,570 --> 00:30:07,810
We'll be spending a lot of time together,

522
00:30:07,810 --> 00:30:09,210
so you can take it easy

523
00:30:09,940 --> 00:30:11,850
and just call me Lan Qing from now on.

524
00:30:11,850 --> 00:30:12,660
Then...

525
00:30:13,380 --> 00:30:14,770
You can call me Pingjun.

526
00:30:15,750 --> 00:30:16,440
Pingjun.

527
00:30:22,810 --> 00:30:23,750
Du Liniang

528
00:30:23,770 --> 00:30:25,460
and Liu Mengmei in this play

529
00:30:25,720 --> 00:30:27,700
may have had a brilliant love story,

530
00:30:27,700 --> 00:30:29,070
but you never know what life will bring.

531
00:30:29,070 --> 00:30:31,000
They were separated by life and death.

532
00:30:31,000 --> 00:30:31,900
This is fate.

533
00:30:33,010 --> 00:30:34,870
Women inside and outside the play

534
00:30:35,050 --> 00:30:35,740
share

535
00:30:36,270 --> 00:30:37,660
the same bitter fate.

536
00:30:38,220 --> 00:30:39,150
That's not true.

537
00:30:39,460 --> 00:30:41,110
I actually want to compose a play

538
00:30:41,110 --> 00:30:42,310
to show everyone that

539
00:30:42,350 --> 00:30:44,310
women are not
just like duckweed at the mercy of fate.

540
00:30:44,310 --> 00:30:45,770
Women can also use the pen

541
00:30:45,770 --> 00:30:47,300
for their own life stories.

542
00:30:47,420 --> 00:30:48,620
Then when you finish,

543
00:30:48,770 --> 00:30:50,300
you must read it to me first.

544
00:30:52,900 --> 00:30:53,330
Deal.

545
00:30:57,010 --> 00:30:57,750
Deng Yaohui,

546
00:30:58,090 --> 00:30:58,810
your two dogs

547
00:30:58,810 --> 00:30:59,920
bit quite a few people,

548
00:30:59,920 --> 00:31:00,790
yet you still walk them to show off?

549
00:31:00,790 --> 00:31:01,810
It's just for thrills!

550
00:31:01,810 --> 00:31:03,470
I'll just pay for the damages.

551
00:31:07,720 --> 00:31:10,250
You bumped into me
and didn't even apologize?

552
00:31:16,590 --> 00:31:17,400
I'm sorry.

553
00:31:18,310 --> 00:31:19,110
Ye Pingjun.

554
00:31:20,500 --> 00:31:21,440
I heard you've been

555
00:31:21,440 --> 00:31:23,300
doing odd jobs in a troupe lately.

556
00:31:23,660 --> 00:31:25,500
Didn't your family teach you

557
00:31:25,590 --> 00:31:26,500
decency

558
00:31:27,290 --> 00:31:28,420
and manners?

559
00:31:28,900 --> 00:31:30,200
Did you forget?

560
00:31:30,310 --> 00:31:31,510
She is fatherless

561
00:31:31,610 --> 00:31:32,720
and ignorant.

562
00:31:32,810 --> 00:31:35,010
How could she know decency and manners?

563
00:31:36,720 --> 00:31:37,790
People like you

564
00:31:37,790 --> 00:31:39,010
who make trouble out of nothing

565
00:31:39,010 --> 00:31:40,310
and badmouth others

566
00:31:40,830 --> 00:31:42,380
are the truly ignorant ones.

567
00:31:42,380 --> 00:31:43,640
How dare you insult me?

568
00:31:43,700 --> 00:31:44,850
Do Second Young Lady Tao and the others

569
00:31:44,850 --> 00:31:46,850
hold any grudge against Ye Pingjun?

570
00:31:47,420 --> 00:31:48,820
You're pretty eloquent.

571
00:31:49,350 --> 00:31:50,290
Can you sing?

572
00:31:50,500 --> 00:31:50,960
Come on.

573
00:31:53,380 --> 00:31:54,710
Sit here and sing for me.

574
00:31:54,750 --> 00:31:55,550
Sing one song,

575
00:31:55,980 --> 00:31:57,510
and I'll reward you
with 10 silver dollars.

576
00:31:57,510 --> 00:31:59,040
How does that song go again?

577
00:32:00,090 --> 00:32:01,400
♪ Oh, dear ♪

578
00:32:01,400 --> 00:32:05,160
♪ You are my beloved sweetheart ♪

579
00:32:05,160 --> 00:32:08,790
♪ Why are you always so cold to me? ♪

580
00:32:11,900 --> 00:32:13,350
You don't want to make such easy money?

581
00:32:13,350 --> 00:32:15,410
I'll give you 10 more silver dollars.

582
00:32:16,550 --> 00:32:17,410
Don't touch me!

583
00:32:36,480 --> 00:32:38,010
You hurt Young Master Deng.

584
00:32:38,310 --> 00:32:39,440
But Young Master Deng

585
00:32:39,440 --> 00:32:41,440
is a gentleman who's nice to ladies.

586
00:32:41,480 --> 00:32:42,510
If you kneel down

587
00:32:42,770 --> 00:32:44,100
and kowtow to him 3 times

588
00:32:44,270 --> 00:32:46,000
nicely and loudly,

589
00:32:46,660 --> 00:32:48,330
he might just let you go.

590
00:32:49,510 --> 00:32:50,520
-Yeah.
-Just kowtow loudly.

591
00:32:50,520 --> 00:32:51,030
Do it!

592
00:32:51,030 --> 00:32:51,660
We're all waiting.

593
00:32:51,660 --> 00:32:53,090
He got handsy first.

594
00:32:54,660 --> 00:32:55,990
Why should I apologize?

595
00:32:58,110 --> 00:32:59,350
You've got some nerve.

596
00:32:59,350 --> 00:33:00,410
You asked for this.

597
00:33:02,350 --> 00:33:03,750
Bring the dogs over here!

598
00:33:05,570 --> 00:33:06,500
Bring them over!

599
00:33:13,200 --> 00:33:14,180
Scared?

600
00:33:14,850 --> 00:33:15,910
You're done for.

601
00:33:16,000 --> 00:33:17,250
Don't do anything crazy.

602
00:33:17,250 --> 00:33:18,560
Now you're scared?

603
00:33:18,610 --> 00:33:20,270
These two dogs are really fierce.

604
00:33:20,270 --> 00:33:21,830
They've already hurt quite a few people.

605
00:33:21,830 --> 00:33:22,480
Listen,

606
00:33:22,900 --> 00:33:24,230
with your small figure,

607
00:33:24,440 --> 00:33:26,700
you wouldn't even be a mouthful for them.

608
00:33:30,550 --> 00:33:31,750
I'll count to 10.

609
00:33:32,140 --> 00:33:33,540
If you still don't kneel,

610
00:33:34,460 --> 00:33:35,660
we'll let them loose.

611
00:33:35,920 --> 00:33:36,610
Kneel.

612
00:33:36,720 --> 00:33:37,310
Kneel!

613
00:33:39,530 --> 00:33:40,570
One.

614
00:33:45,030 --> 00:33:46,640
Two.

615
00:33:48,940 --> 00:33:49,740
Changxuan,

616
00:33:50,160 --> 00:33:52,290
it'll be a mess if she really gets hurt.

617
00:33:53,460 --> 00:33:54,460
I'd like to see

618
00:33:55,610 --> 00:33:57,500
how long she can keep being obstinate.

619
00:33:57,500 --> 00:33:58,790
Three.

620
00:34:01,290 --> 00:34:02,050
Miss.

621
00:34:02,290 --> 00:34:03,090
Miss!

622
00:34:03,830 --> 00:34:05,000
Miss, there's trouble!

623
00:34:05,000 --> 00:34:06,350
Young Master Deng and Young Master Yu

624
00:34:06,350 --> 00:34:07,850
are bullying Miss Ye

625
00:34:07,850 --> 00:34:09,460
with two giant wolfhounds!

626
00:34:10,260 --> 00:34:11,120
Where are they?

627
00:34:11,800 --> 00:34:13,400
Are you going to kneel or not?

628
00:34:17,210 --> 00:34:18,090
Kneel down!

629
00:34:18,210 --> 00:34:19,150
Kneel!

630
00:34:19,300 --> 00:34:20,190
Kneel!

631
00:34:20,480 --> 00:34:21,980
Just kneel!

632
00:34:24,010 --> 00:34:26,340
You're throwing your weight around here,

633
00:34:27,010 --> 00:34:29,540
simply riding
on your ancestors' coattails.

634
00:34:29,820 --> 00:34:31,550
Without your fathers' titles,

635
00:34:32,190 --> 00:34:33,400
what do you have left?

636
00:34:34,400 --> 00:34:36,530
You want me to kneel to people like you?

637
00:34:36,590 --> 00:34:37,590
Honestly,

638
00:34:38,820 --> 00:34:40,020
you don't deserve it.

639
00:34:41,810 --> 00:34:42,920
Release the dogs now!

640
00:34:42,920 --> 00:34:43,590
Bite her!

641
00:34:44,550 --> 00:34:45,350
Yes, bite her!

642
00:34:45,420 --> 00:34:45,949
Bite her!

643
00:34:46,800 --> 00:34:47,330
Bite her!

644
00:34:47,360 --> 00:34:47,889
Bite her!

645
00:34:48,389 --> 00:34:48,920
Bite her!

646
00:34:48,929 --> 00:34:49,460
Bite her!

647
00:34:53,130 --> 00:34:53,820
Let's see if you

648
00:34:53,820 --> 00:34:55,420
still dare to run your mouth.

649
00:35:08,800 --> 00:35:09,510
Xinxin!

650
00:35:09,820 --> 00:35:10,590
Xinxin!

651
00:35:11,320 --> 00:35:11,760
Who?

652
00:35:11,880 --> 00:35:12,880
Who fired the gun?

653
00:35:21,030 --> 00:35:22,290
Fifth Young Master Yu?

654
00:35:22,300 --> 00:35:23,420
What are you doing?

655
00:35:27,780 --> 00:35:28,610
Why is Fifth Young Master Yu

656
00:35:28,610 --> 00:35:30,010
protecting her

657
00:35:30,460 --> 00:35:31,550
in front of everyone?

658
00:35:31,550 --> 00:35:32,590
Fifth Young Master Yu,

659
00:35:32,590 --> 00:35:33,610
this mere waitress

660
00:35:33,610 --> 00:35:34,400
is so arrogant.

661
00:35:34,400 --> 00:35:34,880
Pingjun.

662
00:35:34,880 --> 00:35:36,140
She's the one to blame!

663
00:35:37,570 --> 00:35:38,260
Fifth Young Master,

664
00:35:38,260 --> 00:35:39,860
Pingjun is my copyist.

665
00:35:40,190 --> 00:35:41,320
She is still so young.

666
00:35:41,320 --> 00:35:42,110
If she did anything

667
00:35:42,110 --> 00:35:43,650
offending these young masters,

668
00:35:43,650 --> 00:35:45,150
could you please do me a favor

669
00:35:45,150 --> 00:35:46,750
and let her go just this once?

670
00:35:47,300 --> 00:35:48,430
If someone dies here

671
00:35:49,230 --> 00:35:50,430
and ruins this place,

672
00:35:50,940 --> 00:35:52,800
how can they keep doing business?

673
00:35:55,650 --> 00:35:56,320
Ziyi!

674
00:36:07,420 --> 00:36:08,420
Take the dog away.

675
00:36:08,460 --> 00:36:08,880
Yes.

676
00:36:11,510 --> 00:36:12,440
Are you alright?

677
00:36:14,460 --> 00:36:15,040
Lan Qing,

678
00:36:15,860 --> 00:36:17,800
It's windy outside. Don't catch a cold.

679
00:36:17,800 --> 00:36:19,130
Go back inside quickly.

680
00:36:19,190 --> 00:36:19,710
Okay.

681
00:36:23,650 --> 00:36:24,400
Miss Ye.

682
00:36:25,860 --> 00:36:27,060
Do your job properly.

683
00:36:27,500 --> 00:36:28,760
If there is a next time,

684
00:36:29,400 --> 00:36:31,130
you probably won't be so lucky.

685
00:36:35,320 --> 00:36:35,880
Let's go.

686
00:36:39,610 --> 00:36:40,230
Fifth Young Master Yu's

687
00:36:40,230 --> 00:36:41,830
acting a bit weird, isn't he?

688
00:36:42,650 --> 00:36:44,050
Listen to me!

689
00:36:45,360 --> 00:36:46,050
Look,

690
00:36:46,460 --> 00:36:48,090
Fifth Young Master Yu let her out

691
00:36:48,090 --> 00:36:48,820
and even killed

692
00:36:48,820 --> 00:36:49,690
Deng Yaohui's precious dog

693
00:36:49,690 --> 00:36:51,050
for her.

694
00:36:52,500 --> 00:36:53,090
He's not the type

695
00:36:53,090 --> 00:36:54,690
to show tenderness to women.

696
00:36:57,000 --> 00:36:57,920
I got it.

697
00:36:59,150 --> 00:37:00,150
Could it be that

698
00:37:01,010 --> 00:37:01,920
Fifth Young Master Yu

699
00:37:01,920 --> 00:37:03,580
simply doesn't like that dog?

700
00:37:04,800 --> 00:37:06,600
That doesn't seem right either.

701
00:37:06,920 --> 00:37:08,150
Be honest with me,

702
00:37:08,150 --> 00:37:08,420
is it...

703
00:37:08,420 --> 00:37:10,550
Is it your place to guess his thoughts?

704
00:37:13,320 --> 00:37:14,360
I should have asked

705
00:37:14,360 --> 00:37:15,620
someone else, not you.

706
00:37:15,670 --> 00:37:16,300
You...

707
00:37:17,590 --> 00:37:19,190
It was pointless asking him.

708
00:37:23,550 --> 00:37:24,960
The Commander has told Changxuan

709
00:37:24,960 --> 00:37:27,130
again and again to lay low.

710
00:37:27,260 --> 00:37:28,130
But look at him,

711
00:37:28,130 --> 00:37:30,390
turning a deaf ear to his father's words.

712
00:37:30,460 --> 00:37:31,580
He got involved

713
00:37:31,920 --> 00:37:33,730
in an assassination the other day.

714
00:37:33,730 --> 00:37:34,730
And now,

715
00:37:35,050 --> 00:37:36,760
he runs out every day.

716
00:37:36,870 --> 00:37:37,550
Mom,

717
00:37:38,050 --> 00:37:39,400
I've heard that

718
00:37:39,500 --> 00:37:41,360
Changxuan and Second Young Lady Tao

719
00:37:41,360 --> 00:37:42,860
have grown quite close lately.

720
00:37:42,860 --> 00:37:43,730
He

721
00:37:43,730 --> 00:37:46,050
and Daiti were childhood sweethearts.

722
00:37:46,150 --> 00:37:47,130
But ever since Daiti

723
00:37:47,130 --> 00:37:48,340
went to America,

724
00:37:48,420 --> 00:37:49,780
the girls around Changxuan

725
00:37:49,780 --> 00:37:51,760
have been changing like a revolving door.

726
00:37:51,760 --> 00:37:52,420
You know what?

727
00:37:52,420 --> 00:37:54,690
I actually quite like Daiti.

728
00:37:56,550 --> 00:37:57,870
If she were here,

729
00:37:58,150 --> 00:38:00,210
maybe Changxuan would listen to her.

730
00:38:00,820 --> 00:38:02,130
This cousin of mine

731
00:38:02,260 --> 00:38:02,960
is indeed

732
00:38:02,960 --> 00:38:04,300
very outstanding.

733
00:38:04,730 --> 00:38:07,050
She graduated
from a top women's college in America.

734
00:38:07,050 --> 00:38:08,110
And my uncle

735
00:38:08,110 --> 00:38:10,050
is a pastor
of the Methodist Episcopal Church,

736
00:38:10,050 --> 00:38:11,450
who is highly respected.

737
00:38:11,500 --> 00:38:12,230
He's attached

738
00:38:12,230 --> 00:38:14,300
great importance
to her education since she was little.

739
00:38:14,300 --> 00:38:15,440
My cousin

740
00:38:15,530 --> 00:38:16,590
is certainly

741
00:38:16,590 --> 00:38:17,650
no ordinary woman.

742
00:38:18,300 --> 00:38:20,730
If Daiti really becomes
my fifth sister-in-law,

743
00:38:20,730 --> 00:38:21,650
I'm afraid our family

744
00:38:21,650 --> 00:38:23,910
will have to worship two different gods.

745
00:38:24,150 --> 00:38:25,860
What do you mean
by "two different gods," Jinxuan?

746
00:38:25,860 --> 00:38:27,000
Isn't that obvious?

747
00:38:27,260 --> 00:38:29,900
Mother is a Buddhist,
and Daiti is a Christian.

748
00:38:29,920 --> 00:38:30,960
Wouldn't our family

749
00:38:30,960 --> 00:38:32,690
have to worship both Guanyin

750
00:38:32,690 --> 00:38:34,110
and Jesus?

751
00:38:34,360 --> 00:38:36,150
I just wonder if these two gods

752
00:38:36,150 --> 00:38:37,230
will clash.

753
00:38:38,940 --> 00:38:40,000
Jinxuan, you've thought

754
00:38:40,000 --> 00:38:41,550
of every detail.

755
00:38:43,340 --> 00:38:44,470
This is impressive.

756
00:38:49,860 --> 00:38:51,030
As for Second Young Lady Tao,

757
00:38:51,030 --> 00:38:53,690
her father is in charge
of the financial sector,

758
00:38:53,780 --> 00:38:55,280
with a bright future.

759
00:38:55,860 --> 00:38:58,190
These girls are both quite good.

760
00:38:58,360 --> 00:39:00,090
As long as Changxuan is happy,

761
00:39:00,460 --> 00:39:02,460
I will agree to whoever he likes.

762
00:39:04,440 --> 00:39:06,120
It's just that you never know how fate

763
00:39:06,120 --> 00:39:07,230
will unfold.

764
00:39:07,340 --> 00:39:09,260
But anyone who can marry
into the Yu family

765
00:39:09,260 --> 00:39:10,400
is lucky.

766
00:39:13,860 --> 00:39:15,400
Is this what you want?

767
00:39:18,090 --> 00:39:19,420
Thank you, First Madam.

768
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:32,720
[Treat men and women of all ages
in internal and external medicine]

769
00:39:43,130 --> 00:39:43,940
Miss,

770
00:39:44,630 --> 00:39:46,100
I'm closing soon.

771
00:39:46,760 --> 00:39:48,160
That girl might not come.

772
00:39:48,630 --> 00:39:49,960
What are you going to do?

773
00:39:50,710 --> 00:39:51,210
Sir,

774
00:39:51,530 --> 00:39:52,660
I'll buy these meds.

775
00:39:56,890 --> 00:40:06,100
[Treat men and women of all ages
in internal and external medicine]

776
00:40:12,400 --> 00:40:13,010
Freeze.

777
00:40:14,880 --> 00:40:15,610
Don't worry,

778
00:40:16,510 --> 00:40:17,370
I won't scream.

779
00:40:24,070 --> 00:40:25,000
Don't follow me.

780
00:40:26,030 --> 00:40:26,660
Feng Yao.

781
00:40:34,210 --> 00:40:34,650
I don't know

782
00:40:34,650 --> 00:40:36,070
how you found this out,

783
00:40:38,260 --> 00:40:40,040
but you'd better stay out of it.

784
00:40:40,460 --> 00:40:42,190
Just pretend you didn't see me.

785
00:40:42,460 --> 00:40:44,300
You knew the consequences

786
00:40:44,300 --> 00:40:46,100
of assassinating Yu Changxuan.

787
00:40:46,710 --> 00:40:48,910
We've had no grudge against each other.

788
00:40:50,570 --> 00:40:52,430
Why did you make me the scapegoat?

789
00:40:56,500 --> 00:40:58,760
I have no idea what you're talking about.

790
00:40:59,260 --> 00:41:01,390
You were there during the application

791
00:41:01,510 --> 00:41:03,360
but gone during the interview.

792
00:41:03,740 --> 00:41:04,670
Where did you go?

793
00:41:06,420 --> 00:41:07,710
They looked down on me

794
00:41:08,260 --> 00:41:10,210
and didn't even
let me attend the interview.

795
00:41:10,210 --> 00:41:11,810
What about the fountain pen?

796
00:41:12,280 --> 00:41:13,610
How do you explain that?

797
00:41:14,070 --> 00:41:15,650
There are so many identical fountain pens.

798
00:41:15,650 --> 00:41:17,250
How can you be sure it's mine?

799
00:41:17,860 --> 00:41:18,510
If you really

800
00:41:18,510 --> 00:41:19,670
didn't frame me,

801
00:41:20,650 --> 00:41:22,310
wouldn't your first question

802
00:41:22,550 --> 00:41:23,480
have been,

803
00:41:23,480 --> 00:41:24,760
"What fountain pen?"

804
00:41:42,920 --> 00:41:43,610
That day,

805
00:41:45,030 --> 00:41:46,360
I didn't know it was you.

806
00:41:47,530 --> 00:41:48,090
I planned

807
00:41:48,090 --> 00:41:49,690
to just pin it on a random guy.

808
00:41:50,110 --> 00:41:50,760
The servants there

809
00:41:50,760 --> 00:41:52,560
all have some good backgrounds.

810
00:41:52,880 --> 00:41:54,550
Although they might suffer a bit,

811
00:41:54,550 --> 00:41:55,300
their families

812
00:41:55,300 --> 00:41:56,670
would bail them out.

813
00:41:57,440 --> 00:41:58,840
It was just a coincidence

814
00:41:59,010 --> 00:42:00,140
that I passed by you.

815
00:42:01,130 --> 00:42:02,380
But you were risking your life,

816
00:42:02,380 --> 00:42:03,420
assassinating Yu Changxuan.

817
00:42:03,420 --> 00:42:04,730
Why did you do that?

818
00:42:12,230 --> 00:42:13,610
My family of five

819
00:42:14,960 --> 00:42:17,010
was all killed by Yu Changxuan.

820
00:42:18,530 --> 00:42:20,530
So even if it costs me my life,

821
00:42:22,420 --> 00:42:24,710
I will make him pay for it with his life.

822
00:42:30,000 --> 00:42:30,610
Run!

823
00:42:30,980 --> 00:42:31,930
I'll stall them.

824
00:42:32,010 --> 00:42:32,800
Go!

825
00:42:33,010 --> 00:42:33,820
Go ahead!

826
00:42:59,070 --> 00:43:00,330
Fifth Young Master Yu.

827
00:43:01,570 --> 00:43:02,900
What are you doing here?

828
00:43:06,070 --> 00:43:07,800
I came to get meds for my mother.

829
00:43:10,010 --> 00:43:11,070
Where are the meds?

830
00:43:16,280 --> 00:43:17,940
I was just about to fetch them.

831
00:43:21,840 --> 00:43:22,420
Didn't you just

832
00:43:22,420 --> 00:43:24,880
get some for your mother
a couple of days ago?

833
00:43:26,380 --> 00:43:27,510
Why do you need more?

834
00:43:36,530 --> 00:43:37,340
Besides...

835
00:43:38,820 --> 00:43:39,730
isn't there a pharmacy

836
00:43:39,730 --> 00:43:41,990
at the entrance of the alley to your home?

837
00:43:42,650 --> 00:43:44,510
Why bother going all the way here?

838
00:43:49,630 --> 00:43:50,360
I came out

839
00:43:51,460 --> 00:43:53,320
to buy yunpian pastries for my mom

840
00:43:53,880 --> 00:43:55,740
and thought I'd get the meds, too.

841
00:44:11,000 --> 00:44:12,440
Yes! It was her!

842
00:44:12,780 --> 00:44:13,760
She came to me

843
00:44:13,780 --> 00:44:15,230
to identify a girl.

844
00:44:15,390 --> 00:44:16,210
That was her.
